            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#B76E79] uppercase tracking-wider">Quick Answers</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
              Frequently Asked Questions
